{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44240","headline":"情书寄李子安 · 鱼玄机","name":"情书寄李子安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮冰食蘖志无功，晋水壶关在梦中。\n秦镜欲分愁堕鹊，舜琴将弄怨飞鸿。\n井边桐叶鸣秋雨，窗下银灯暗晓风。\n书信茫茫何处问，持竿尽日碧江空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}